    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <ul>
        <li>All research published here is done on software I wrote myself, open-source software, or systems I'm explicitly authorized to test.</li>
        <li>I don't publish bypasses for live games' security measures or anti-cheat products, and I don't publish detection techniques targeting specific cheat providers.</li>
        <li>If I find a vulnerability and you're reading about it? It's already been sent to the vendor, properly disclosed, and I've been given permission to publish it.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
